nt@5; npx prisma db push; npm run db:seed`. I'll run these sequentially. I will also be setting up the environmental path, and then making a report.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"$env:PATH = \\\"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\nodejs;\\\" + $env:PATH; npm install prisma@5 @prisma/client@5 --save-exact 2>&1; npx prisma db push 2>&1; npm run db:seed 2>&1\"","Cwd":"\"C:\\\\Delta Force\\\\kts-vinhlong\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"60000","toolAction":"\"Setting up database\"","toolSummary":"\"Database setup and seed\""}}]}
